{
  "id": "KHS39hnCeJtKzMET",
  "name": "Invoice & Receipt Extractor — AI bookkeeping with validation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invoice & Receipt Extractor\nTwo entry points, one pipeline:\n- **Gmail**: new emails with a PDF invoice attached\n- **Webhook**: `POST { text }` from any app\n\nGemini extracts vendor, dates, taxes (GST · HST · PST · QST), line items and a spend category. A Code step **re-adds the numbers** — if line items, taxes and total don't reconcile, the document is marked `needs_review` and posted to `#finance`.\n\n**Setup:** Google Gemini, Gmail OAuth, Google Sheets and Slack credentials.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8b55888f-6ba8-5401-a298-0c0896e98d8a",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -40
      ]
    },
